	TAD M2 		/RESET
	DCA TEM1 		/ROTATION COUNTER
PUT,	TAD PNTR 		/WHICH WORD IS THIS?
	TAD TEM2 		/ADDRESS IS FORMED FROM CNTR2 AND A
	DCA TEM3 		/POINTER, TO GET RELEVANT SYMBOL WORD
	TAD CHAR 		/GET CHARACTER
	TAD I TEM3 	/ADD IN PREVIOUS CHARACTER
	DCA I TEM3 	/STORE IT
	JMP I NXCHP 	/GO GET NEXT CHARACTER
ROTE,	ISZ TEM2 		/THE FOURTH?
	JMP .+5 		/NO: ROTATE IT
	DCA TEM1 		/YES: ARRANGE COUNTERS
	CMA 		/SO THAT ALL OTHERS ARE
	DCA TEM2 		/IGNORED
	JMP I NXCHP 	/KEEP ACCEPTING CHARS.
	TAD CHAR
	CLL RTL 		/SIX BITS LEFT
	RTL
	RTL
	DCA CHAR 		/PUT IT BACK IN CHAR
	JMP PUT 		/GOT STORE CHARACTER
